    "long_instructions": "##Create Your First Object\r\n\r\n1.  **PROMPT** the AI: Ask AI to \"create a JavaScript object using these properties and values\" from your warm-up list.\r\n2.  **ANALYZE** the Code: Paste the AI's object code into your `script.js` file. Add comments to describe what the AI chose (e.g., property names, default values, data types).\r\n3.  **INTEGRATE** and Modify: Edit the object by adjusting at least one value or adding one new property. (e.g., `myObject.newProp = \"value\";`) Or create an additional object using the one AI created as an example.\r\n4.  **REFLECT** and Inspect: In the `reflection.md` file write comments that compare the AI's logic to your intent and note one thing you learned about object syntax.",
